{"parse":{"title":"Jammu and Kashmir Legislative Assembly","revid":1380219347,"text":"<div><div><h3><span></span>Members of Legislative Assembly (MLA)</h3></div>\n<div role=\"note\">This section is <a href=\"/wiki/Help:Transclusion\" title=\"Help:Transclusion\">transcluded</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/1st_Jammu_and_Kashmir_Assembly_(union_territory)\" title=\"1st Jammu and Kashmir Assembly (union territory)\">1st Jammu and Kashmir Assembly (union territory)</a>. <span>(<a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=1st_Jammu_and_Kashmir_Assembly_(union_territory)&amp;action=edit\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=1st_Jammu_and_Kashmir_Assembly_(union_territory)&amp;action=edit\">edit</a> &#124; <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=1st_Jammu_and_Kashmir_Assembly_(union_territory)&amp;action=history\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=1st_Jammu_and_Kashmir_Assembly_(union_territory)&amp;action=history\">history</a>)</span></div>\n<p>The membership of the assembly is as follows:<sup><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span>&#91;</span>1<span>&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th rowspan=\"2\">District\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Constituency\n</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\">Name\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Party\n</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\">Remarks\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>No.\n</th>\n<th>Name\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"6\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kupwara_district\" title=\"Kupwara district\">Kupwara</a>\n</td>\n<th>1\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Karnah_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Karnah Assembly constituency\">Karnah</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Javaid_Ahmad_Mirchal\" title=\"Javaid Ahmad Mirchal\">Javaid Ahmad Mirchal</a>\n</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"Jammu and Kashmir National Conference\">\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Jammu_and_Kashmir_National_Conference\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Jammu and Kashmir National Conference\">JKNC</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>2\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Trehgam_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Trehgam Assembly constituency\">Trehgam</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Saifullah_Mir\" title=\"Saifullah Mir\">Saifullah Mir</a>\n</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"Jammu and Kashmir National Conference\">\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Jammu_and_Kashmir_National_Conference\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Jammu and Kashmir National Conference\">JKNC</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>3\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Kupwara_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Kupwara Assembly constituency\">Kupwara</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mir_Mohammad_Fayaz\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mir Mohammad Fayaz\">Mir Mohammad Fayaz</a>\n</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"Jammu and Kashmir People&#39;s Democratic Party\">\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Jammu_and_Kashmir_People%27s_Democratic_Party\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Jammu and Kashmir People&#39;s Democratic Party\">JKPDP</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>4\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Lolab_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Lolab Assembly constituency\">Lolab</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Qaysar_Jamshaid_Lone\" title=\"Qaysar Jamshaid Lone\">Qaysar Jamshaid Lone</a>\n</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"Jammu and Kashmir National Conference\">\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Jammu_and_Kashmir_National_Conference\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Jammu and Kashmir National Conference\">JKNC</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>5\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Handwara_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Handwara Assembly constituency\">Handwara</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Sajjad_Gani_Lone\" title=\"Sajjad Gani Lone\">Sajad Gani Lone</a>\n</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"Jammu and Kashmir People&#39;s Conference\">\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Jammu_and_Kashmir_People%27s_Conference\" title=\"Jammu and Kashmir People&#39;s Conference\">JKPC</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>6\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Langate_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Langate Assembly constituency\">Langate</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Khursheed_Ahmed_Sheikh\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Khursheed Ahmed Sheikh\">Khursheed Ahmed Sheikh</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Jammu_and_Kashmir_Awami_Ittehad_Party\" title=\"Jammu and Kashmir Awami Ittehad Party\">AIP</a><sup><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span>&#91;</span>2<span>&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"7\"><a href=\"/wiki/Baramulla_district\" title=\"Baramulla district\">Baramulla</a>\n</td>\n<th>7\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Sopore_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Sopore Assembly constituency\">Sopore</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Irshad_Rasool_Kar\" title=\"Irshad Rasool Kar\">Irshad Rasool Kar</a>\n</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"Jammu and Kashmir National Conference\">\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Jammu_and_Kashmir_National_Conference\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Jammu and Kashmir National Conference\">JKNC</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>8\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Rafiabad_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Rafiabad Assembly constituency\">Rafiabad</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Javid_Ahmad_Dar\" title=\"Javid Ahmad Dar\">Javid Ahmad Dar</a>\n</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"Jammu and Kashmir National Conference\">\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Jammu_and_Kashmir_National_Conference\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Jammu and Kashmir National Conference\">JKNC</a>\n</td>\n<td><i>Cabinet Minister</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>9\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Uri_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Uri Assembly constituency\">Uri</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Sajjad_Safi\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sajjad Safi\">Sajjad Safi</a>\n</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"Jammu and Kashmir National Conference\">\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Jammu_and_Kashmir_National_Conference\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Jammu and Kashmir National Conference\">JKNC</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>10\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Baramulla_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Baramulla Assembly constituency\">Baramulla</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Javid_Hassan_Baig\" title=\"Javid Hassan Baig\">Javid Hassan Baig</a>\n</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"Jammu and Kashmir National Conference\">\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Jammu_and_Kashmir_National_Conference\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Jammu and Kashmir National Conference\">JKNC</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>11\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Gulmarg_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Gulmarg Assembly constituency\">Gulmarg</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Pirzada_Farooq_Ahmed_Shah\" title=\"Pirzada Farooq Ahmed Shah\">Pirzada Farooq Ahmed Shah</a>\n</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"Jammu and Kashmir National Conference\">\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Jammu_and_Kashmir_National_Conference\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Jammu and Kashmir National Conference\">JKNC</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>12\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Wagoora%E2%80%93Kreeri_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Wagoora–Kreeri Assembly constituency\">Wagoora–Kreeri</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Irfan_Hafiz_Lone\" title=\"Irfan Hafiz Lone\">Irfan Hafiz Lone</a>\n</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"Indian National Congress\">\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Indian_National_Congress\" title=\"Indian National Congress\">INC</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>13\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Pattan_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Pattan Assembly constituency\">Pattan</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Javaid_Riyaz\" title=\"Javaid Riyaz\">Javaid Riyaz</a>\n</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"Jammu and Kashmir National Conference\">\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Jammu_and_Kashmir_National_Conference\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Jammu and Kashmir National Conference\">JKNC</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bandipora_district\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bandipora district\">Bandipora</a>\n</td>\n<th>14\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Sonawari_Assembly_constituency\" title=\"Sonawari Assem